    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The images of pieces by Maurice Henry, Carl Fredrik Reuterswärd and Antoni Tàpies were copied from:\n\nWilly Rotzler: Objektkunst. Von Duchamp bis zur Gegenwart. Köln: DuMont Schauberg, 1975.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Wittgenstein quote was taken from John R. Searle: The Rediscovery of the Mind. Cambridge, Mass.: MIT Press, 1992, p. 126.",
      "links": []
